+/* The ISR mix loop. Walks DOS_PIXTONE_CHANNELS channel-pool slots; for
+ * each active slot, reads Pixtone mono samples + stereo-duplicates each
+ * into one stereo L+R pair of dma_dst, applying gain (int32 multiply +
