+ * Format reconciliation:
+ *   - Pixtone PCM under Tier-2 = signed 16-bit MONO at 11025 Hz per
+ *     `vendor/nxengine-evo/src/sound/Pixtone.cpp:567` SDL_AudioSpec.
+ *   - SB16 DMA stream is FORCED stereo S16 at sb.c:1294-1295 (the
+ *     SB16 branch unconditionally sets device->spec.channels = 2).
+ *   - dma_dst therefore contains interleaved L/R int16 samples: dst[0]
+ *     = L_0, dst[1] = R_0, dst[2] = L_1, dst[3] = R_1, etc.
+ *   - Each Pixtone mono sample maps to ONE stereo L+R pair; mixing
+ *     writes the same sample value into both channels of the pair
+ *     (centered, no panning). v2 candidate: per-channel pan via
+ *     differential gain_x256 for L vs R (positional audio for stereo).
+ *
+ * Loop count: n_samples = dma_len / 2 = total int16 slots in dma_dst.
+ * n_stereo_pairs = n_samples / 2 = number of L+R pairs (= Pixtone mono
+ * samples consumed per IRQ). At Tier-2 (256 sample-frames * 4 bytes =
+ * 1024 bytes / IRQ = 512 int16 slots = 256 stereo pairs), one IRQ
+ * consumes 256 Pixtone mono samples (= 23.2 ms at 11025 Hz; matches
+ * the 11025 Hz stereo output rate).
